Some elements are withing iframe tag.
It is a webpage within another webpage.
To interact with element that is within iframe, we need to switch frames first.
To this:
1. We create a constant with element that is the iframe we want to enter:
const iframeLocator = page.frameLocator('iframeLocator');

2. We combine the iframe locator with our target element:
await iframeLocator.getByRole('button', {name, 'Click Me'}).click();